      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_25",
      "hash64": "3701ED7640A81DD7",
      "text": "要多拿出點狠勁來才行喔。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_dog_06",
      "hash64": "F61CB28454B46C23",
      "text": "嚕呼嗚……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_26",
      "hash64": "3701EE7640A81F8A",
      "text": "呼……怎麼辦，\\n我的心到現在還噗通噗通猛跳。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_27",
      "hash64": "3701EF7640A8213D",
      "text": "在[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳跟赫月對戰的時候，\\n我拍照拍得都忘我了。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_28",
      "hash64": "3701E07640A807C0",
      "text": "我想讓助手[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的\\n寶可夢們休息一下。\\r\\n我們先回據點去吧。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_29",
      "hash64": "3701E17640A80973",
      "text": "收帳篷的時候，\\n總會有種依依不捨的感覺。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_30",
      "hash64": "37056E7640AB2EE1",
      "text": "助手，真是辛苦[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_31",
      "hash64": "37056D7640AB2D2E",
      "text": "靠[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的幫忙才拍到的這些東西，\\n我想要把它們好好呈現出來……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_32",
      "hash64": "37056C7640AB2B7B",
      "text": "這種感覺真的……\\n很久很～久不曾有過了。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_33",
      "hash64": "37056B7640AB29C8",
      "text": "心動不如行動！\\n我想把照片洗出來，\\r\\n得趕快回村子去才行！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_34",
      "hash64": "3705727640AB35AD",
      "text": "沙儷家的傳家格言就是\\n「時間寶貴」！\\r\\nTime is money！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "s1_side02_0050_camera_35",
      "hash64": "3705717640AB33FA",
      "text": "我們翠綠鎮再見吧！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
